BULGU SEVIYESI: ORTA (Medium)
KAPSAM: Tum Linux Sunuculari"
  solution    : "echo 'X11Forwarding no' >> /etc/ssh/sshd_config"
  reference   : "800-53|AC-3,CSCv8|4.1,CIS-L1|5.2.6"
  file        : "/etc/ssh/sshd_config"
  regex       : "^\s*X11Forwarding\s+"
  expect      : "^\s*X11Forwarding\s+no\b"
